OL,3,ASeven killed and 23 missing after boat
OL,4,Acapsizes off northern Cyprus
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe boat left from the northern Cypriot
OL,7,Fport of Kyrenia at 11:58 local time
OL,8,F(09:58 BST) and officials say it
OL,9,Fcapsized around four nautical miles
OL,10,Finto its journey to Turkey
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
